<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus to auction up to 35 mln in 91-day bills.</title>
<headline>Cyprus to auction up to 35 mln in 91-day bills.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus's central bank will auction up to 35 million pounds ($70 million) in 91-day treasury bills with an April 9 issue date, the bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The statement from the central bank replaces an earlier one issued on March 31 which called for bids for up to 25 million pounds of bills.</p>
<p>Bids can be made from April 7 to 9.00 a.m local (0600 GMT) on April 9, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>($=0.50 pounds)</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
</text>
